   $q$How does the word "therefore" in the first sentence of paragraph 5 help develop the passage's key concept?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It signals a shift to a new topic unrelated to the earlier paragraphs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-transition"},{"text":"It shows the paragraph draws a conclusion from the causes explained earlier.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It introduces a contrast with the explanation given in paragraph 4.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-transition-type"},{"text":"It marks the next step in a timeline of events through the year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-transition-type"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows the paragraph draws a conclusion from the causes explained earlier.$q$, $q$"Therefore" signals a result: since red depends on sunny days and cool nights, weather shapes each year's colors. It connects to paragraph 4 rather than contrasting with it.$q$, 'draft', '9d669a71-47e6-5bb8-981f-6a86d8c0dad4')
