  ('37bb256e-f45f-57c0-acba-1894ea3fa680', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g8-theme-summary'), null, 'hard',
   $q$How does the final scene, in which Marrow hands Flick a branch, add to the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that Marrow mainly wants Flick to admit that she was right.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It proves that the storm was Flick's fault and not simply bad weather.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-evidence"},{"text":"It changes the theme to the idea that speed is the key to success.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It suggests that careful habits can be shared, so a failure can lead to better work.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It suggests that careful habits can be shared, so a failure can lead to better work.$q$, $q$By telling Flick "Bend it first" and "we will build," Marrow passes on her careful method, extending the theme. She never asks him to admit anything, so that reading adds a motive the text does not show.$q$, 'draft', '36f09db0-0b06-5387-95c7-e0f4e37728ea')
