   $q$Which statement best expresses a theme of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Exciting displays always impress science fair judges most.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Music has no effect on any kind of living thing.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"Honest results have value even when they are not what you hoped.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Relatives usually give poor advice about school projects.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Honest results have value even when they are not what you hoped.$q$, $q$Ines reports data that does not support her idea, and the judge takes her work seriously. The judge's interest in her plain poster shows that a flashy display is not what matters most here.$q$, 'draft', '619559cb-4aeb-5a94-856c-38b5c72f3ffb')
