   $q$What is the author's main purpose in this notice?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To announce the dates when the county will spray each neighborhood","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"To warn residents that a serious mosquito illness is spreading in the county","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"To explain where mosquitoes breed and urge residents to empty standing water weekly","is_correct":true},{"text":"To describe the life of mosquitoes that live in distant swamps","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To explain where mosquitoes breed and urge residents to empty standing water weekly$q$, $q$The notice explains that mosquitoes hatch near homes and asks residents to "tip out anything holding water" once a week. It says "there is no reason for alarm," so it is not warning of an outbreak.$q$, 'draft', '5344bbe8-db9c-50be-8140-c9dadbd13a83')
